<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 62 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 62 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 62 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged, and amounts (in million dirhams) accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID    AMOUNT		INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	  -	  -			8.5  pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks	  -	  -			9.0  pct</p>
<p>    Two years	 -	  -			9.5  pct</p>
<p>    10 years	  -	  -		     10.25 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	 62	 62		     10.50 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    62	 62</p>
<p>The next auction will take place on December 10, 1996, the bank said.</p>
<p>($1= 8.8 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
